{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 固定 PR 公理呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_S=(0,e_S)\">\\(E_S=(0,e_S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)\">\\(\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span>、句法程序及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的公式构造全部固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LRefl}_g\">\\(\\mathrm{LRefl}_g\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RLoc}_g\">\\(\\mathrm{RLoc}_g\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>。本条的初始证明公式固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}\\)</span>；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 阶基础 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cup R_n(S)\">\\(S\\cup R_n(S)\\)</span> 使用下式唯一生成的公理公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\">\\(\\alpha_n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 为公理代码变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为证明公式的结论代码变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为与二者不同的新鲜变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decF}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{decF}_g\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sn}\">\\(\\operatorname{sn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在下式定义；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\ell\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\">\\(e_\\ell\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_2\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_\\ell⟧=\\ell\">\\(⟦ e_\\ell⟧=\\ell\\)</span>。扩展函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{e_\\ell}\">\\(F_{e_\\ell}\\)</span> 及消去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_D\">\\(E_D\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2fbf7ac563ea4261\" href=\"?note=2fbf7ac563ea4261\" title=\"67-df-pr-definitional-extension\">67-df-pr-definitional-extension</a>；对象公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sn}\">\\(\\operatorname{sn}\\)</span> 使用其同一指定程序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_n,\\alpha_n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\">\\(\\rho_n,\\alpha_n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n(S),R_\\omega(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(R_n(S),R_\\omega(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y&lt;z+1\">\\(\\exists y&lt;z+1\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y(y&lt;z+1\\land\\cdots)\">\\(\\exists y(y&lt;z+1\\land\\cdots)\\)</span> 的既有缩写；数值加一与对象语言项分别按所在层次使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell(a,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng\\!\\left(\\mathrm{LRefl}_g\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\operatorname{decF}_g(a)},\\operatorname{decF}_g(n)\\right)\\right),&amp;\na\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\left(a\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]\\right),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;a\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ n&lt;\\ell(a,n),\\\\\n\\rho_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(z=z),&amp;\\alpha_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z),&amp;R_0(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nR_{n+1}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\alpha_n}),\\\\\n\\rho_{n+1}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\left(\n\\exists y&lt;z+1\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{sn}(y)=1\\land\nF_{e_\\ell}(\\overline{g(\\alpha_n)},y)=z\\bigr)\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha_{n+1}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z)\\lor\\rho_{n+1}(z),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\left(\\mathbb N_A\\models\\rho_n(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\varphi\\in R_n(S)\\right),\\\\\nR_\\omega(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}R_n(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell(a,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng\\!\\left(\\mathrm{LRefl}_g\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\operatorname{decF}_g(a)},\\operatorname{decF}_g(n)\\right)\\right),&amp;\na\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}],\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\left(a\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]\\right),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;a\\in g[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]]\\land n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}]\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ n&lt;\\ell(a,n),\\\\\n\\rho_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(z=z),&amp;\\alpha_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z),&amp;R_0(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nR_{n+1}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\alpha_n}),\\\\\n\\rho_{n+1}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq E_D\\!\\left(\n\\exists y&lt;z+1\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{sn}(y)=1\\land\nF_{e_\\ell}(\\overline{g(\\alpha_n)},y)=z\\bigr)\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha_{n+1}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z)\\lor\\rho_{n+1}(z),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\left(\\mathbb N_A\\models\\rho_n(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\varphi\\in R_n(S)\\right),\\\\\nR_\\omega(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}R_n(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>对应印刷55页/PDF66页的迭代定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_1(S)=\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\">\\(R_1(S)=\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\)</span>。这里没有把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{n+1}\">\\(R_{n+1}\\)</span> 错写成公理集合的累加并；所加基础 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cup R_n(S)\">\\(S\\cup R_n(S)\\)</span> 已由源递归确定。各有限阶段的自然公理测试有效且 PR，故递归可继续；全体有限迭代的并只作为 r.e. 句集使用，不宣称它字面 PR。固定呈示及自然数递归确定每一步的唯一输出。</p>\n<p>上述 ℓ 的合法输出把输入句子作为真子树保留；本册树编码使真子树代码小于整树代码。因此模板识别可界于输出代码，而不依赖未写出的“自然公理呈示”选择。初始阶段直接取 α₀=σ_S，以免仅可证等价的 σ_S∨⊥ 被误说成逐字相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-pr-definitional-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-definitional-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor"